@startuml Create_Milestone
title Activity Diagram - Create Milestone

|Instructor|
start
:Select a project;
:Click "Create Milestone";
:Enter milestone details:\n- Title (required)\n- Description\n- Due Date\n- Weight (%);
:Click "Create";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send request to create\nnew milestone;

|Backend API|
:Validate request body;
:Call ProjectMilestoneService.\nCreateAsync(request);
:Check if title is provided;
if (Title empty?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 Bad Request\n"Title is required";
  stop
endif

:Check weight range (0-100);
if (Weight invalid?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 Bad Request\n"Weight must be between 0 and 100";
  stop
endif

:Get current total weight\nof all milestones in project;
:Calculate new total weight\n= currentTotal + newWeight;
if (Total weight > 100%?) then (yes)
  :Return 400 Bad Request\n"Total weight would be {total}, exceeds 100";
  stop
endif

:Create ProjectMilestone entity:\n- ProjectId\n- Title\n- Description\n- DueDate\n- Status = "Planned"\n- Weight\n- CreatedAt;
:Save to database;
:Return ProjectMilestoneResponseDto;
:Send 201 Created response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh milestones list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View new milestone in list;
stop
@enduml

